                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ba103a7-c493-3b3d-a096-4dc7f2584102",
                        "entry_id": "5a7f5149-66e7-3df7-9d5c-b311b44bc696",
                        "glosses": [
                            "oops (acknowledging a minor mistake)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6adbe01c-1d91-4c3c-9720-2fd2a2d9f72d",
                                "sense_id": "3ba103a7-c493-3b3d-a096-4dc7f2584102",
                                "text": "И хара́ктер у москвиче́й та́кже по́ртится. Всё каки́е-то «ва́у», «упс» — как-бу́дто мы в Нью-Йо́рке, что́ ли.\nI xarákter u moskvičéj tákže pórtitsja. Vsjo kakíje-to «váu», «ups» — kak-búdto my v Nʹju-Jórke, štó li.",
                                "translation": "And the character of Muscovites is also getting worse. All those \"wows\" and \"oopses\" — as if we're in New York or something.",
                                "english": "And the character of Muscovites is also getting worse. All those \"wows\" and \"oopses\" — as if we're in New York or something."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4b8ac2e1-0285-37b9-933e-353a8765d1ed",
                "word": "упс",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "040fa680-09ea-38c1-a755-a574a099564a",
                        "entry_id": "4b8ac2e1-0285-37b9-933e-353a8765d1ed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жарг. выражает сожаление, досаду по поводу внезапно замеченного упущения, собственной оплошности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33a786df-57b4-47fb-962a-b6ff6d18bda0",
                                "sense_id": "040fa680-09ea-38c1-a755-a574a099564a",
                                "text": "«Это так дивно», продолжала она, — упс! (конверт соскользнул с дивана на пол, она подняла его), «так невероятно дивно с твоей стороны… такую уйму денег!»"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8047cdcd-5749-4199-9a57-a866398f98e5",
                                "sense_id": "040fa680-09ea-38c1-a755-a574a099564a",
                                "text": "Больной пожаловался на доктора, который его оперировал под местным наркозом. Ему не понравилось, что доктор, сделав разрез, сказал «упс»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2840e17f-fb79-48f0-b63e-ffb866432516",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b8ac2e1-0285-37b9-933e-353a8765d1ed",
                        "source_sense_id": "040fa680-09ea-38c1-a755-a574a099564a",
                        "target_lang_word": "oops",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oops",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f5df83a-474e-3c4e-941d-6ad91a09d211",
                                        "entry_id": "c3bf5891-9b5f-3a38-8fce-d16ee3f62a0c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acknowledging a mistake."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd80213d-46e0-41f2-a33a-79fed663fa75",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5df83a-474e-3c4e-941d-6ad91a09d211",
                                                "text": "Oops! I left the lid off the ketchup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d67cf56-9095-4d3d-b43b-b94538f890b4",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5df83a-474e-3c4e-941d-6ad91a09d211",
                                                "text": "Oops, I did it again / I played with your heart, got lost in the game"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "oops",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                        "entry_id": "140782cc-5b6d-3129-a6da-b5a9703dfe36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A minor mistake or unforeseen difficulty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6191f2dc-2eb6-4c0e-80e5-53136e6e93ac",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "It's an oops, but one that's your fault, not your puppy's."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83bc38cf-8584-4d97-a654-a74a20b8dbda",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "Every plan and every activity has an “oops.” Oops, we forgot to..., oops, who was supposed to do that? We all have experienced “oopses”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b29c08c-0228-441a-b567-ae35f714a80d",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "Isn't she the same woman who works at Wings that you and Billy almost got arrested for helping her with her last little oops?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a43234b-4769-4a2d-8ab5-68aedfb9e1ac",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "My parents had moved to this house, which sat on the border of Corktown and Mexicantown, from their tiny apartment in Ann Arbor—once they found out that their little oops was actually two little oops."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "oops",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af974ac2-a3a1-3c85-b10c-3d4b1fc2b0f7",
                                        "entry_id": "04570e76-46d8-3720-bcad-b9441e58deb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a mistake; to blunder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
